# Environment
.env

# Go
/bin/
*.test
*.out
coverage.txt

# Node / web
web/node_modules/
# dist/ is real build output (npm run build), gitignored except for a
# committed placeholder index.html - //go:embed requires the directory to
# be non-empty at `go build` time, and cmd/api falls back to serving that
# placeholder when the real dashboard hasn't been built (see web/embed.go).
web/dist/*
!web/dist/index.html

